    <detaileddescription>
<para>Abstract base class for nonlinear solvers.</para>
<para>This is required because the <ref refid="class_generic_solver" kindref="compound">GenericSolver</ref> is templated, so the implementation of the <ref refid="class_non_linear_solver_1ab9dba2383dc2918c7e3742da3efc062d" kindref="member">solve()</ref> function should be in the header of the file that implements it (or explicitly instantiated for all VectorTypes...) FIXME: Make this clearer (-: </para>
    </detaileddescription>
